6. PROBLEM STATEMENTS, ARCHIVAL COPIES, AND DERIVED DATA
---------------------------------------------------------

This repository is an archival and educational project. It may preserve
historical snapshots of external problem pages and may convert them into
Markdown, local image links, JSON records, static catalogs, or other derived
representations.

Conversion, cleaning, formatting, hashing, indexing, validation, or
publishing of an upstream work does not transfer ownership of that upstream
work. It also does not by itself create permission to redistribute that work.

Metadata and status fields may be assembled from public pages, authenticated
records, local verification, or project-generated observations. The fact that
a value is stored in JSON or displayed on GitHub Pages does not make the
underlying source content Original Materials.

If a rights holder requests clarification, attribution, correction, or removal
of material, the project maintainer may review the request and the relevant
source and repository history. Nothing in this section is a representation
that every archived item is independently cleared for every use.


